            "review_title": "Review at Yakitori Ginza",
            "review_text": "Nguyen Duy Vin\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nThe number 1 Yakitori in Ho Chi Minh city\nMar 2025 • Friends\nThe great place for family and friend. We had dinner with kids and friends of 6 person. Skewers are tender juice and flavoured smoke and chicken. Beyond the expectations I had in Japan- country we love for travel. Staff was nice and full attention on your table service and chef make sure skewers for kids are match the level of salt and perfection of grill. \nDraff beer were served by freeze glass made Sapporo so good.\nSake did not expensive as I thought. \nGreat team, we will come back.\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2025",
